{"title":"2026 MADE Best of Show & People’s Choice Award Winners","link":"https://bikerumor.com/2026-made-best-of-show-peoples-choice-award-winners/","date":1788377250000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-hero.jpeg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" alt=\"(Photos / MADE Show)\" /></p>\n<p>This year’s <a href=\"https://made.bike/\" target=\"_blank\">MADE</a> Show was pretty special for so many reasons. The energy that surrounds the show is positive and inspiring. I’ve said it time and time again: you can really feel the love of the bicycle as you walk through the show. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-first-pic.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-first-pic.jpeg\" alt=\"MADE Show 2026 Awards first pic\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-first-pic.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-first-pic-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-first-pic-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-first-pic-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-first-pic-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-first-pic-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a><figcaption>(All Photos / MADE Show)</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>While attending the past four shows, I noticed that there was <em>never</em> any negativity from anyone… exhibitor and attendee alike. Everyone is always smiling, laughing, embracing, and chatting. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-left.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-left.jpeg\" alt=\"MADE Show 2026 Awards big shot left\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-left.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-left-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-left-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-left-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-left-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-left-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The overall vibe is that we are all here together, as a whole, to celebrate the unique craftsmanship of the independent frame builder. The bicycle is a true form of functional art, and to see so many clever and skillful interpretations of the bike is awe-inspiring.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-right.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-right.jpeg\" alt=\"MADE Show 2026 Awards big shot right\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-right.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-right-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-right-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-right-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-right-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-big-shot-right-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>That being said, I am not always a fan of “art awards”, as art can be very subjective. But bikes are a little different. Right? I mean, as much as frame building is a true art form and a great way for a builder to express themselves, it still needs to resemble and operate like a bicycle in the end. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Awards can also make a world of difference for small frame builders to make a name for themselves, so without further ado, here are the winners for the MADE 2026 Best in Show &amp; People’s Choice Awards!</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Best in Show Winners</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-best-of-show-winners.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-best-of-show-winners.jpeg\" alt=\"MADE Show 2026 Awards best of show winners\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-best-of-show-winners.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-best-of-show-winners-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-best-of-show-winners-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-best-of-show-winners-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-best-of-show-winners-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-best-of-show-winners-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a><figcaption>(left to right) Rob English (English Cycles), Brian Hall (Rare Earth Cycle), Santiago Toro (Scarab Cycles)</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3><strong><a href=\"https://www.englishcycles.com/\" target=\"_blank\">English Cycles</a></strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-ribbon.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-ribbon.jpeg\" alt=\"MADE Show 2026 Awards english ribbon\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-ribbon.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-ribbon-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-ribbon-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-ribbon-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-ribbon-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-ribbon-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-with-builder.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-with-builder.jpeg\" alt=\"MADE Show 2026 Awards english with builder\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-with-builder.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-with-builder-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-with-builder-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-with-builder-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-with-builder-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-english-with-builder-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3><strong><a href=\"https://www.scarabcycles.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Scarab Cycles</a></strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-ribbon.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-ribbon.jpeg\" alt=\"MADE Show 2026 Awards scarab ribbon\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-ribbon.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-ribbon-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-ribbon-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-ribbon-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-ribbon-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-ribbon-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-with-builder.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-with-builder.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-with-builder.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-with-builder-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-with-builder-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-with-builder-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-with-builder-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-scarab-with-builder-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3><strong><a href=\"https://www.rareearthcycle.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rare Earth Cycle</a></strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-rare-earth-ribbon.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https: