"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-peoples-choice-award-winners.jpeg\" alt=\"MADE Show 2026 Awards peoples choice award winners\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-peoples-choice-award-winners.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-peoples-choice-award-winners-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-peoples-choice-award-winners-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-peoples-choice-award-winners-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-peoples-choice-award-winners-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-peoples-choice-award-winners-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a><figcaption>(left to right): Ashley King (Significant Other Bikes), Justin Foote (Fiddlehead Cycles), Charles Thompson (Fine Bikes)</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3><strong>1st Place: <a href=\"https://www.fiddleheadcycles.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Fiddlehead Cycles</a></strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fiddlehead-ribbon.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fiddlehead-ribbon.jpeg\" alt=\"MADE Show 2026 Awards fiddlehead ribbon\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fiddlehead-ribbon.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fiddlehead-ribbon-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fiddlehead-ribbon-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fiddlehead-ribbon-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/