w-2026-Awards-fine-and-ribbon-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fine-and-ribbon-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fine-and-ribbon-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fine-with-builder.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fine-with-builder.jpeg\" alt=\"MADE Show 2026 Awards fine with builder\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fine-with-builder.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fine-with-builder-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fine-with-builder-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fine-with-builder-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fine-with-builder-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-fine-with-builder-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3><strong>3rd Place: <a href=\"https://www.significantother.bike/\" target=\"_blank\">Significant Other Bikes</a></strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-ribbon.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-ribbon.jpeg\" alt=\"MADE Show 2026 Awards sig other ribbon\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-ribbon.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-ribbon-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-ribbon-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-ribbon-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-ribbon-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-ribbon-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-with-builder.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-with-builder.jpeg\" alt=\"MADE Show 2026 Awards sig other with builder\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-with-builder.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-with-builder-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-with-builder-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-with-builder-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-with-builder-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MADE-Show-2026-Awards-sig-other-with-builder-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>Also: 2027 MADE Show Says Goodbye to Zidell Yards </h2>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3533-e1788367445268.png\"><img width=\"1663\" height=\"1996\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3533-e1788367445268.png\" alt=\"2026 MADE Show Awards Billy Sinkford\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3533-e1788367445268.png 1663w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3533-e1788367445268-250x300.png 250w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3533-e1788367445268-1536x1844.png 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3533-e1788367445268-100x120.png 100w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3533-e1788367445268-768x922.png 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3533-e1788367445268-1280x1536.png 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3533-e1788367445268-750x900.png 750w\" /></a><figcaption>(Photo / Miles Arbor of Bikepacking.com)</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Since I have you guys here… It was <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/made-show-announces-new-venue-for-2027-official-show-bike-gallery-kicks-off-2026/\" target=\"_blank\">announced at this year’s MADE Show that this was the last MADE Show to be held at the Zidell Yards</a>. That’s a little bittersweet for me. I thought the “Yards” was a perfect venue for the show spiritually, but it had its issues. I mean, it’s a huge open-air, 100-year-old barge manufacturing building; it was to be expected. Sure, the aesthetics matched the vibe of the show perfectly, but the amenities fell short.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Anywho, that’s all in the past now. After their fourth year at “The Yards”, it’s time for MADE to move on. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>But where are they going, you ask? </p>\n\n\n\n<h2>New MADE Show Venue </h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The 2027 MADE Show will be held at the Portland Convention Center, in you guessed it… Portland, Oregon.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The show dates are<strong> </strong>August 6th, 7th &amp; 8th.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Bikerumor will for sure be in attendance, giving you stellar coverage as always. We’re looking forward to seeing the new venue up close and personal. And we’re excited for the future of the MADE Show! It’s a great time! </p>\n\n\n\n<p>If any more details come our way, we’ll be sure to let you guys know. So, keep an eye out. </p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://made.bike/\" target=\"_blank\">MADE.Bike</a></em></p>","author":"Ron Frazelle","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/2026-made-best-of-show-peoples-choice-award-winners/#respond","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"2cb7bd93778086dc0d5a2c7a327b85ae2e1cdfd739bdc4abf0575e8c2aa1ef5e","category":"Cycling"}